description: UIUX standards — spacing, hierarchy, typography, colors, motion, layout
globs: src/**/*.tsx

## UIUX Rules (LabCircuitos — tema claro fijo)
1. Page title: text-2xl font-semibold text-ink
2. Section title: text-lg font-semibold text-ink
3. Body: text-sm text-ink-muted
4. Caption: text-xs text-ink-faint
5. Spacing: Tailwind scale (4 = 16px base)
6. Cards: rounded-xl, border border-surface-700, bg-surface-800, shadow-panel
7. Colors: primary = verde bosque (#1F4D3A), gold = acciones INICIAR, ink = texto, surface = fondos crema
8. No emojis — use initial-letter boxes or text badges
9. Animations: 0.2-0.3s, fade+slide-up pattern
10. Tema: solo claro — usar tokens `surface`, `ink`, `primary`, `gold` (ver docs/TEMA_UI.md). No usar `dark:` ni fondos oscuros
11. Responsive: mobile-first, test at 375/768/1024/1440
